{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>A trumpet [of] silver.</b> The verbal noun, with the tsadi deficient in pronunciation, if it is written:" "<b>For the calling.</b> A verbal noun, and likewise ולמסע ['and for the journeying']. Or it is a noun, and the meaning is: at the time of calling and at the time of journeying. And the first is correct in my eyes."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:58.512657727Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}